      "message": "docs(mcp): skill row for pass_start on every kind that has it\n\nThe skill said that other kinds get pass_start in their own issues.\nMain has the key on 2D Pocket, 2D Offset, 2D Adaptive, Circular, Bore,\n3D Pocket and 3D Finish. The row now says which kinds take it, the\nabsent and auto rule, where the app says the choice is not used, and\nwhich kinds refuse it by name.\n\nFixes #3569\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
